      "id": "claim_ee42bd6fcd7945e8996be069d4dc8ea0",
      "statement": "The server, not the client, authorizes project-scoped workspace policy: it rejects claimed project fields, verifies the client-claimable session policy fingerprint, resolves policy for the canonical target directory, and persists the server-authoritative workspace payload with the thread binding.",
