      "statement": "The server constructs a runtime by snapshotting workspace environment and credentials, configuring tracing, resolving a model and tools, optionally opening a sandbox, and compiling the CLI agent; the resulting runtime contains the graph, composite backend, server-owned offload operation, and metadata.",
